<item>2. Die <hi rendition="#aq">particula</hi> &#x1F10;&#x03C6;<foreign xml:lang="gre"><gap reason="fm" unit="chars"/></foreign> &#x1FA7; <hi rendition="#fr">&#x017F;intemal, nach-<lb/>
