<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b">Erkla&#x0364;rung des Briefs Pauli <hi rendition="#et">Cap. 15, v. 1-8.</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#b">Das funfzehente Capitel.<lb/>
