<item><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#aq">V. APOLOGETICA:</hi></hi> Darinnen der A-<lb/>
po&#x017F;tel die <hi rendition="#fr">Verunglimpfungen der fal&#x017F;chen</hi><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Apo&#x017F;tel</hi></fw><lb/>
