<fw type="catch" place="bottom">9. CHri-</fw><lb/>
<pb n="611" facs="#f0639"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b">Cap. 2, v. 1. an die Ephe&#x017F;er.</hi></fw><lb/>
<cb/>
<list><item>9. CHri&#x017F;tus i&#x017F;t das Haupt der Gemeine in<lb/>
